---
description: Raabta hub and sub-screen design contract
globs: lib/screens/**,lib/core/widgets/hub/**,lib/features/**/presentation/**
alwaysApply: false
---
Follow docs/HUB_DESIGN_CONTRACT.md and the Raabta design kits in docs/.
- Compose existing shared hub components; never create one-off cards, badges, sheets or state views.
- Tokens only (ColorFamily, AppSpacing, AppRadius, AppTypography / HubTypography). No hardcoded hex, radius or text styles.
- Hub chrome is brand purple; one content hue at most (gold for money and legal, teal for community); semantic colors only for status.
- Dark, light, RTL, text scale 1.3, 9 locales. Skeletons not spinners on hub feeds. Flag-gated controls are hidden, never disabled.
- Never fake data. No payment wording, no star ratings. Optimistic UI only for reversible taps (save/favorite).
- If no pattern fits, stop and report instead of inventing a style.
